  Original captures regenerated from their archived raw protocol output and
  checked against request nonce, command hash, firmware assets, frozen runtime,
  strict read-fault enforcement, original effect entry and audio-read counts.
  Archived originals have no outer-runner completion envelope; this limitation
  is retained. Host captures have completed-run records. No tolerance is used.
  Inputs: six frames at 0,16,32,64,128,256 milliseconds; volumeSmth values
  0,1.5,64,1023.75,512.5,0; 20x6 logical geometry, factory holes and 120-pixel bus.
  Compared every logical and mapped RGB byte and all 12 segment-state bytes.

