Claim boundary
  Original effect instructions and original WLED helper closure execute against
  an authored memory Bus. Inputs are processed volumeSmth and an expanded palette.
  This is not a full S3 WLED boot, physical LED driver or raw PDM audio test.
  The two 100-second runs verify these scripted Running trajectories with SR off
  and on. They cover 8402 original/fixed frame comparisons with zero byte/state
  differences. Other effects retain short checks. Full original/port S3 firmware,
  raw microphone DSP and hardware-boundary output acceptance remain open.
  No hardware was accessed or flashed. Vendor bytes and captures remain untracked.
